---
---
<section class="feature">
  <div class="mk-container feature-inner">
    <div class="feature-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">Why it works</p>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 60ms">Practice that's actually spaced.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
        Cramming feels productive and mostly isn't. Retrieval spread out over days beats
        one long session — it's one of the few study techniques with real evidence behind it,
        not just a study-influencer opinion.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
        Studyus schedules short recall checks automatically, timed to when you're about
        to forget — not when it's convenient for an app to remind you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-vignette reveal reveal-scale" style="--reveal-delay: 160ms" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="flip-card">
        <div class="flip-inner">
          <div class="face front">
            <p class="face-label">Recall check</p>
            <p class="face-topic">Light-dependent reactions</p>
            <p class="face-hint">What's produced besides ATP?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="face back">
            <p class="face-label">Recalled</p>
            <p class="face-topic">NADPH ✓</p>
            <p class="face-hint">Next check in 4 days</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .feature { padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vw, 88px); }
  .feature-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 380px);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mk-font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mk-muted);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 38px);
    max-width: 17ch;
  }
  .feature-copy p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--mk-muted);
    max-width: 50ch;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .flip-card {
    perspective: 1400px;
    height: 190px;
  }
  .flip-inner {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transform: rotateY(180deg);
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .js .reveal .flip-inner { transform: rotateY(0deg); }
    .js .reveal.is-in .flip-inner {
      transition: transform 900ms var(--mk-ease-out) 450ms;
      transform: rotateY(180deg);
    }
  }
  .face {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    backface-visibility: hidden;
    -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
    background: var(--mk-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--mk-border);
    border-radius: var(--mk-radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--mk-shadow-pop);
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .back { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
  .face-label {
    font-family: var(--mk-font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mk-faint);
  }
  .face-topic {
    font-family: var(--mk-font-display);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .back .face-topic { color: var(--mk-accent-ink); }
  .face-hint {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--mk-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .feature-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .feature-vignette { max-width: 380px; }
  }
</style>
